          (∀ Q Q' : Place (ResidueField ↥A) FSS, Q ∉ N → Q' ∉ N → ∀ (n : ι) (P : Place (AlgebraicClosure ℚ) ↥(fieldBar q M')), P ∈ Dn Q n → P ∈ Dn Q' n → Q = Q') ∧

